Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.17,0:00:09.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你弟弟正步入危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother is heading down a dangerous road, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.04,0:00:10.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.47,0:00:11.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我入伙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.84,0:00:13.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你告诉迪恩我们的行动了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna tell dean about what we're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.18,0:00:14.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正想着要怎么说合适呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got to figure out the right way to say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.68,0:00:16.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna find out,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.08,0:00:17.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不是从你口中得知  他会发火的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if it's not from you, he's gonna be pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.88,0:00:19.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正他都会发火的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna pissed anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.22,0:00:21.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你满意了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You satisfied?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.62,0:00:22.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么那么相信她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you trust her so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.95,0:00:25.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  是她帮我逃离莉莉丝的魔爪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, dean, she helped me go after lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.46,0:00:27.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  诠释得很生动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thanks for the thumbnail -- real vivid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.42,0:00:29.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在楼下的时候  一定发生了什么大事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something major must've happened while I was downstairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.59,0:00:32.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我回来的时候  你正和恶魔亲热\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I come back and -- and you're bff with a demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.70,0:00:34.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不要说下细节呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to fill in a little detail?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.96,0:00:37.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然啦  迪恩  我们都说下自己的事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, dean. let's trade stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.30,0:00:39.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你先吧  地狱怎样  别太啰嗦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You first. how was hell? don't spare the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.53,0:01:10.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.17,0:01:12.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特德喜欢使唤人  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ted's kind of cracking the whip, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.87,0:01:16.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我喜欢晚回家吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I like coming home late?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.64,0:01:18.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都快累死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm working my ass off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.51,0:01:19.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.61,0:01:23.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.52,0:01:27.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  是我对不住你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.49,0:01:30.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.69,0:01:32.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,漫长的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.33,0:01:36.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我今天遇到了吉尔·马丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hey. I ran into jill martin today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.93,0:01:38.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖瑞星期六过40岁生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gary's turning 40 on saturday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.93,0:01:40.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.06,0:01:42.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她请我们参加生日派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}She invited us to the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.30,0:01:44.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么跟她说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you tell her?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.40,0:01:46.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我答应她去啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we'd go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.77,0:01:50.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.27,0:01:51.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.71,0:01:52.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢盖瑞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like gary.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.98,0:01:54.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不错  但这并不表示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that doesn't mean
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.25,0:01:56.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想和那个家伙浪费我的周末时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I want to waste my saturday night with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.48,0:01:58.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你会去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you'd want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.09,0:02:05.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.89,0:02:08.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.36,0:02:11.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会  我会打给吉尔  告诉她我们不去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll -- I'll call jill and tell her we can't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.46,0:02:16.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚你是怎么啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's with you tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.77,0:02:19.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉你想找人吵架\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like you want to have a fight or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.47,0:02:31.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第4季第14集]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.73,0:02:50.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我正想告诉你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's what I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.33,0:02:54.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有风暴  庄稼收成也好  一切正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}No storms, no -- no bad crops, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.87,0:02:57.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.44,0:02:58.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  我会继续留意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I will keep looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.78,0:03:01.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也留意下  行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep looking, too, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.78,0:03:03.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的 再联系吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, talk soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.06,0:03:12.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.06,0:03:15.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起床开工啦  老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up and at 'em, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.86,0:03:18.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你起得真早  在干嘛呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're up early. what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.43,0:03:20.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么  刚上洗手间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. I was in the can.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.73,0:03:22.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.40,0:03:25.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对啊  要我给你画张画吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. want me to draw you a picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.10,0:03:26.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  还是算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.80,0:03:28.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找到新活了  爱荷华州  贝德福德\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found a job -- bedford, iowa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.74,0:03:31.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个男人用嫩肉针砸死了她的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy beat his wife's brains out with a meat tenderizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.18,0:03:32.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.48,0:03:34.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个是两个月内第三起\N{\fnArial\fs30}And get this -- third local inside two months
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.11,0:03:35.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀害妻子的事故了\N{\fnArial\fs30}To gank his wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.51,0:03:38.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都没有前兆  婚姻也一直美满\N{\fnArial\fs30}No priors on any of them, all happily married.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.02,0:03:39.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来像是“奥齐与哈丽雅特”(美国经典爱情故事)\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like "Ozzie and Harriet."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.85,0:03:41.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更像是“闪灵”(美国恐怖片)\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like "the Shining."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.05,0:03:45.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们还是探个究竟\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, I guess we better have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.82,0:03:47.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警察局怎么还派人来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does the p.d. keep sending you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.99,0:03:50.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了不需要律师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already said I don't want a lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.06,0:03:51.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们正准备对你行刑呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're lining up the firing squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.40,0:03:52.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我承认自己有罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pleading guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.80,0:03:54.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  既然你不需要我们当你的代理律师\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, look, you don't want us to represent you --
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.87,0:03:56.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也行\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.43,0:03:59.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实  对于你我来说也不算坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, it's probably not a bad idea, between you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.84,0:04:03.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只想搞清楚是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just want to understand what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.57,0:04:05.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.81,0:04:07.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本森先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. benson...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.45,0:04:10.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}...please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.16,0:04:21.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened was...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.83,0:04:25.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我杀了我妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.06,0:04:28.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至于原因嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you want to know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.13,0:04:32.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她没征求我意见就擅自做了决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because she made plans without asking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.27,0:04:37.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那当时  你是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it happened, how did you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.11,0:04:38.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意识模糊  失控了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disoriented? out of control?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.88,0:04:41.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是像被支配了一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like something possessed you to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.01,0:04:42.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道自己做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew exactly what I was doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.41,0:04:44.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很清醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.11,0:04:45.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你为什么要那样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.22,0:04:46.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.22,0:04:47.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爱她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I loved her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.78,0:04:50.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在一起很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.83,0:05:04.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,9千美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}9 g's.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.30,0:05:07.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这笔帐可不小\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a hefty bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.54,0:05:08.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你从哪得到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.77,0:05:11.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这无关紧要  我们有就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't matter. we have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.01,0:05:12.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看  这些付款\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, certain charges --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.84,0:05:15.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是你不想让你太太知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ones you don't want the missus to know --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.95,0:05:19.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,均签匿名例如“尙奇娱乐”\N{\fnArial\fs30}They show up under shady names like "m & c entertainment."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.82,0:05:21.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  不过我不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.52,0:05:23.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打个比方  就像你在色情酒吧丢了信用卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're dropping plastic at a nudie bar, for instance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.25,0:05:26.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只想弄清楚真相  本森先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just... want to know the truth, mr. benson.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.16,0:05:37.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她叫贾丝敏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her name was...jasmine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.23,0:05:39.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是个脱衣舞女吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was a stripper?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.27,0:05:41.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老弟  人家真名叫贾丝敏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, her name was jasmine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.64,0:05:43.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不希望走到这一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean for it to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.64,0:05:46.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢去脱衣舞酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like to go to strip bars.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.51,0:05:49.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的好朋友开了一个单身派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}My buddy was having a bachelor party,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.85,0:05:53.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后  就遇到了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And...there she was.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.05,0:05:54.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贾丝敏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jasmine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.45,0:05:56.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她走到我面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}She came right up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.05,0:05:59.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.66,0:06:03.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  我不知道  她很\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-i don't know, s-she was just...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.33,0:06:04.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.06,0:06:07.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我喜欢的类型\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything that I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.66,0:06:09.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要你付的钱够多  谁都可能成为你梦中情人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you pay enough, anybody will be anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.60,0:06:11.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这和钱无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't about the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.50,0:06:13.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甚至不关乎性\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't even about the sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.07,0:06:14.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.91,0:06:18.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.91,0:06:22.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.45,0:06:23.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个很难解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hard to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.62,0:06:28.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你妻子发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your wife found out?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.02,0:06:29.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  她一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she never had a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.59,0:06:31.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你为什么要杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why'd you kill her?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.86,0:06:36.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了贾丝敏\N{\fnArial\fs30}For jasmine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.89,0:06:41.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她说我们能永远在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said we would be together forever,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.20,0:06:42.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果 如果\N{\fnArial\fs30}If -- if only j--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.67,0:06:44.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,薇姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vicki was...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.90,0:06:46.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Muerte.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.30,0:06:49.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后  我和贾丝敏约好见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afterwards, me and jasmine were supposed to meet,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.27,0:06:50.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是她一直没出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she never showed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.04,0:06:54.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道她姓啥住哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know where she lives. I don't know her last name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.65,0:06:56.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我甚至连她的真名都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know her real first name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.25,0:07:01.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是个大笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.65,0:07:04.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不想跟警察交代这些事情吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you didn't think to tell this to the cops?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.42,0:07:05.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么用\N{\fnArial\fs30}What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.16,0:07:09.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个脱衣舞女没有杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stripper didn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.09,0:07:11.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人是我杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.93,0:07:14.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我罪有应得\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know what I deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.40,0:07:17.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法官没判我死刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Judge doesn't give me the death sentence,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.93,0:07:21.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就自行了断\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.91,0:07:31.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚很糟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rough night?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.05,0:07:32.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚很开心啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fun night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.32,0:07:33.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早上不爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rough morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.88,0:07:35.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能帮上什么忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.55,0:07:37.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.92,0:07:41.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,FBI特工  斯泰尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm special agent stiles -- fbi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.12,0:07:42.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是卡拉·罗伯茨教授吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dr. cara roberts?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.66,0:07:44.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Far as I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.39,0:07:46.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为州长做事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do some work with the sheriff's department?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.63,0:07:50.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我不在急诊室干苦力的时候就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, when I'm not slogging it through the e.r.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.57,0:07:52.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是个小镇  我们都有多重的活\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a small town. we multitask.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.24,0:07:53.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有一个案子  想问你一些问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I have some questions about a case --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.90,0:07:55.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实际上  有几个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}About several cases, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.24,0:07:57.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,介意我坐下吗  太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mind if I sit? great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.81,0:08:01.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚当·本森  吉姆·威利  还有斯蒂夫·斯耐德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Adam Benson, Jim Wylie, and Steve Snyder?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.98,0:08:04.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢  那几个杀了自己妻子的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. the men who killed their wives.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.15,0:08:05.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你负责病例检查  是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You handled the work-ups, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.95,0:08:09.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对妻子进行了尸检  对凶手则进行毒理检验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm. autopsies for the wives and tox screens for the perps.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.12,0:08:10.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特别针对此案进行的检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two-for-one special.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.49,0:08:11.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.69,0:08:13.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.26,0:08:15.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女尸的需氧量很清晰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, c.o.d. on the women was pretty clear --
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.19,0:08:17.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整个生理系统也很正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was nothing unusual in their system.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.13,0:08:18.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那几个丈夫呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the husbands?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.86,0:08:21.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能再看看你的徽章吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I see your badge again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.44,0:08:32.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was one thing --
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.14,0:08:33.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,血检时发现了点异样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, an anomaly in the blood work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.67,0:08:36.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最让我觉得奇怪的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I remember thinking how strange it was
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.10,0:08:39.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三个男人的血检都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}That it showed up in all three of the men.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.42,0:08:41.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}That what showed up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.52,0:08:42.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,催产素\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oxytocin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.65,0:08:45.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且其含量高到足以让人发疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And their levels were crazy high.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.42,0:08:47.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,催产素是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, oxytocin?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.32,0:08:49.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是一种激素\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm, it's a hormone
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.43,0:08:54.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在分娩期  哺乳期以及性交中产生\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's produced during childbirth, lactation, and sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.70,0:08:57.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.87,0:08:59.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,俗称爱情激素\N{\fnArial\fs30}People call it the love hormone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.27,0:09:01.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还记得你第一次坠入爱河时的感觉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, you know how it feels when you first fall in love --
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.71,0:09:05.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,双腿发软  心中有抹倩影挥之不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole weak-in-the-knees, tattoo-you-on-my-chest thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.11,0:09:06.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是催产素在作怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's oxytocin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.64,0:09:08.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  它终究会消逝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, it eventually fades,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.91,0:09:12.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你则陷入了感情的轮回里无法自拔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you're stuck with every relationship ever,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.62,0:09:17.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种感觉就像消除纹身一样痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}That and the painful regimen of tattoo removal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.29,0:09:22.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我错过了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd I miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.93,0:09:24.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的搭档  梅铎克探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my partner -- Agent Murdock.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.86,0:09:26.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  探员叫起来太不亲切啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, "agent" sounds so formal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.30,0:09:27.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以叫我迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can call me dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.30,0:09:29.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是罗伯茨医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Dr. Roberts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.57,0:09:31.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.27,0:09:33.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有啥我能帮忙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you with anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.30,0:09:36.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了  还有一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh...sure. just one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.54,0:09:37.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个化学的  这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}This chemical, this...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.57,0:09:39.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-催产素  -催产素\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oxytocin. ...- oxytocin
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.54,0:09:42.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你查出了含量过高的原因了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would cause those high levels that you found?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.95,0:09:44.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前所未闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing that I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.15,0:09:48.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  就这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.72,0:09:49.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十分感谢  医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.59,0:10:01.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多句嘴  试下多脂的早餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, uh, try a greasy breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.16,0:10:02.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对宿醉很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best thing for a hangover.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.43,0:10:05.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,悠着点  伙计  我可是这儿唯一的医学博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch it, buddy. I'm the only m.d. here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.77,0:10:12.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老弟  你真是让我刮目相看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, you totally c-blocked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.41,0:10:16.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,威利和斯耐德都认罪了  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Wylie and Snyder fessed up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.18,0:10:17.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个提空了自己的退休金\N{\fnArial\fs30}One emptied his i.r.a.,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.41,0:10:19.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而另一个  提空了他孩子的大学基金\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other, his kid's college fund --
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.08,0:10:20.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有事都指向同一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}All on the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.58,0:10:21.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,包养脱衣舞女吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live nude girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.75,0:10:23.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,俱乐部的名字叫甜蜜旅车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Club called the honey wagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.29,0:10:26.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这两人也和叫贾丝敏的脱衣舞女搞过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}These guys have affairs, too, with a stripper also known as Jasmine?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.79,0:10:28.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是  又不全是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes and no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.06,0:10:29.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有趣的正是这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where it gets interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.73,0:10:31.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每个人钓上的女人都不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each guy hooked up with a different chick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.56,0:10:33.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  这些女孩又是怎么搅在一起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, these girls all connected somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.60,0:10:35.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们所描述的脱衣舞女郎都有一个共同之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they all described their stripper in the same way,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.77,0:10:37.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且完完全全的一致\N{\fnArial\fs30}The exact same way --
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.03,0:10:38.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完美  他们的理想型\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect and everything that they wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.57,0:10:40.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  至少他们幻想的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, at least they'll dream
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.20,0:10:42.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-芭比女郎让他们去谋杀自己的妻子  -就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Barbie convinced them to murder their wives. - there's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.27,0:10:44.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们就像是中了某种爱情魔咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's almost like they were under some kind of love spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.14,0:10:45.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure seems that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.44,0:10:47.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那魔咒让他们彻底疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which caused them to become totally psychotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.61,0:10:49.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全正确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.65,0:10:51.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来很兴奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem pretty cheery.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.62,0:10:53.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脱衣舞女啊  萨姆  尤物啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strippers, sammy. strippers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.92,0:10:57.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可是在调查一单有脱衣舞女的案子噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are on an actual case involving strippers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.22,0:10:59.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是一劳永逸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.21,0:11:20.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找这三个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for three girls --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.61,0:11:24.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贾丝敏  奥罗拉和艾莉尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jasmine, Aurora, and Ariel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.52,0:11:26.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真觉得这些名字对我有意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seriously think those names mean anything to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.35,0:11:28.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个染红发大约5尺9  另一个是亚洲人\N{\fnArial\fs30}One's a redhead about 5'9". the other one's asian about --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.95,0:11:31.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我要和多少女孩打交道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea how many girls I deal with?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.22,0:11:33.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假名  假发  都是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fake names, fake hair, fake...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.89,0:11:36.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该有一些文件存根之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to have some sort of paperwork, check stubs,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.69,0:11:38.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记录她们的行踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some way to keep track of the strippers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.86,0:11:40.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别搞笑了  都是外国妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. exotic dancers --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.90,0:11:43.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只管给她们钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Independent contractors working for cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.37,0:11:44.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他的我都不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stay out of their hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.73,0:11:46.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们给我留下点钱就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}They stay out of what little I have left.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.90,0:11:49.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的三个客人杀了自己的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three of your customers murdered their wives.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.17,0:11:50.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不觉得那很诡异吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think that that's weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.94,0:11:52.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我觉得超诡异\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think that's super-freakin' weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.91,0:11:55.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可这些都不关我事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know what it ain't? my problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.66,0:12:10.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.43,0:12:12.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没  你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.16,0:12:14.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一点  我刚和鲍比谈了谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little. I just talked to bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.53,0:12:16.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行内有个说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We officially have a theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.07,0:12:17.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是什么  -海妖\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's that? - siren.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.27,0:12:19.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希腊传说中的海妖吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like greek-myth siren?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.50,0:12:21.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,“奥德赛”中描写那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like "the odyssey"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.44,0:12:23.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我读过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I read.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.14,0:12:25.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  事实上  海妖不是什么神话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, actually, but the siren's not actually a myth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.28,0:12:28.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更像是某种专门猎捕男人的尤物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's more of a beautiful creature that prey on men,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.08,0:12:30.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用海妖之歌引诱他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Entice them with their siren song.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.01,0:12:31.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜是  “欢迎来到丛林”(枪炮玫瑰乐队)\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess -- "welcome to the jungle"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.92,0:12:34.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不  应该是涡轮乐队的“樱桃派”\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. warrant's "cherry pie"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.18,0:12:36.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,歌声充满隐喻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their song is more of a metaphor --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.25,0:12:38.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,隐含着它们的召唤和引诱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like their call, their allure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.42,0:12:40.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小嘴一挥就能把男人搞得和僵尸一样乖吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they shake their thing and the guys zombie out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.22,0:12:42.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以这么说  海妖生活在海岛上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basically, yeah. sirens live on islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.16,0:12:44.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,海员会疯狂地追逐她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sailors would chase them,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.39,0:12:45.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冲向礁石密布的海域\N{\fnArial\fs30}Completely ignoring the rocky shores,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.00,0:12:47.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果把自己撞得粉碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}And dash themselves to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.40,0:12:48.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像亚当他们三人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like adam and his buddies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.33,0:12:50.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你是09年的海妖\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you were a siren in '09
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.63,0:12:52.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正想要玩弄一些笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}And looking to ruin a bunch of morons,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.27,0:12:53.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你打算从哪里下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where would you set up shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.58,0:13:02.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些勾引男人的尤物\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, whatever floats the guy's boat,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.91,0:13:04.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都长成那样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what they look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.01,0:13:05.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  海妖能读取人的思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. you see, sirens can read minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.78,0:13:07.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们知道你最想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}They see what you want most,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.12,0:13:09.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们能伪装自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then they can kind of, like, cloak themselves --
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.15,0:13:11.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像某种幻术\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, like an illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.62,0:13:13.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就是说可能只有一只海妖\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it could all be the same chick,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.82,0:13:16.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变成不同的梦中女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morphing into different dream girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.66,0:13:18.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恩  很有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, actually. probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.16,0:13:20.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,海妖一般都喜欢独居\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sirens are usually pretty solitary.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.93,0:13:23.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么杀它\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we kill it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.07,0:13:24.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比正在查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby's working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.23,0:13:25.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算我们知道怎么杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}But even if we figure that out...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.97,0:13:28.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么找到它  它可能是任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell are we gonna find it? it could be anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.71,0:13:38.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, belle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.02,0:13:43.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以为你不来了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought you'd never come.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.57,0:14:05.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事了  她睡着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. she's asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.51,0:14:08.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莱尼  你真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lenny, you're amazing...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.58,0:14:11.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么照顾她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking care of her like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.65,0:14:14.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大部分人都会把她送敬老院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most guys would have put her in a nursing home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.95,0:14:16.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.69,0:14:18.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是我妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.76,0:14:22.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如我所说  好棒啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said -- amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.84,0:15:13.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.58,0:15:19.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爱死你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...i love you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.92,0:15:25.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那么照顾我和你妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way you take care of me and your mom --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.56,0:15:28.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你多么的可人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're so sweet...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.76,0:15:30.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又很强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}And strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.73,0:15:34.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只希望你能轻松一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wish you didn't have to carry it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.27,0:15:39.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你妈妈占用了你所有的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, your mom takes up all your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.74,0:15:45.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要她在  我们就没法快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as she's around, we can't really be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.14,0:15:47.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她也没那么糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.95,0:15:50.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以和你在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could be with you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.91,0:15:54.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forever...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.12,0:15:56.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是你妈妈不在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If only your mom wasn't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.72,0:16:01.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你不想和我永生相伴吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you want to be with me forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.59,0:16:06.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.36,0:16:08.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you know I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.34,0:16:15.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就杀了你妈妈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then bash your mother's brains in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.41,0:16:20.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝儿  就算是为了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, do it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.98,0:16:23.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去吧  宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.15,0:16:24.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  行啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.92,0:16:27.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.62,0:16:36.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.29,0:17:46.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.99,0:17:48.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  你在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam? you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.07,0:17:59.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莱尼·布里斯托尔是另一位海妖的受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lenny bristol was definitely another siren vic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.77,0:18:01.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你去看他了吗  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got in to see him?  -Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.44,0:18:03.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他带了一个名叫贝尔的脱衣舞女回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said he brought a stripper home named belle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.21,0:18:05.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几个小时后  他杀死了自己的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple hours later, he offed his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.47,0:18:07.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝尔也从现场消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Belle, of course, went m.i.a.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.04,0:18:08.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  他杀了自己的妈妈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. he killed his mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.11,0:18:10.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个女人指使的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Woman he was closest to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.48,0:18:15.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了  你忘带手机了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you, uh... forgot your cellphone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.39,0:18:22.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.52,0:18:24.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  找到她了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, did you find her yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.46,0:18:25.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.83,0:18:28.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过她好像仍在作案\N{\fnArial\fs30}And doesn't seem like she's slowing down any.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.26,0:18:29.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那边怎么样  有什么新发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you? got anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.73,0:18:33.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从尘土弥漫的希腊诗歌中找到了一些传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, some lore from a dusty greek poem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.40,0:18:35.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狭隘且有点模糊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shockingly, it's a little vague.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.27,0:18:36.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,稍等  我开一下免提\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hold on a sec. I'm gonna put you on speaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.51,0:18:39.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上面说  你需要一把青铜匕首\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says you need "a bronze dagger
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.64,0:18:43.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上面要沾着在咒语之歌控制下的水手之血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Covered in the blood of a sailor under the spell of the song."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.78,0:18:45.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.21,0:18:46.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问到点子上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.78,0:18:49.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们正着手于一项三千年的电话游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're dealing with 3,000 years of the telephone game here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.48,0:18:51.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最佳猜测\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.05,0:18:54.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,海妖的咒语与曲无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the siren's spell ain't got nothing to do with any song.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.62,0:18:58.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更像是某种毒素或毒液\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's most likely some kind of toxin or venom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.36,0:19:00.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从受害者血液中获得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something she gets in the vics' blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.43,0:19:02.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因此他们寻找傀儡\N{\fnArial\fs30}That makes them go all manchurian candidate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.13,0:19:04.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得呢  她利用性来传染男人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, what do you think? she infects the men during sex?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.17,0:19:05.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.17,0:19:06.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯幽皮儿那撤性病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supernatural std.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.80,0:19:09.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不论发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, however it happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.20,0:19:11.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一旦成功了  海妖就会跟进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once it's done, the siren's got to watch her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.81,0:19:13.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果她吞食毒液\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she gets a dose of her own medicine...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.68,0:19:14.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,则自取灭亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}It kills her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.88,0:19:17.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像是毒蛇用毒液把自己毒死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a snake getting iced by its own venom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.18,0:19:19.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们只需在监狱里找个提取下\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we just got to find a way to juice one of the o.j.s in jail?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.61,0:19:20.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没那么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.98,0:19:23.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些人现在已经不受咒语的控制了\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of those guys are under the spell anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.05,0:19:27.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就没什么办法能让你拿到血液了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't got a clue where you're gonna get the blood you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.22,0:19:28.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有个主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I might have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.49,0:19:29.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.83,0:19:31.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些妖精非常狡猾\N{\fnArial\fs30}These things are tricky bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.73,0:19:34.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在你不知情的时候  他们就可能把你包围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrap you up in knots before you know what hit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.10,0:19:40.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗伯茨博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Roberts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.17,0:19:42.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯泰尔斯探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Stiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.04,0:19:44.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等不及了是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't stay away, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.68,0:19:48.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实际上  我们是来谈正事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, we're here on business
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.11,0:19:50.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于那个血样  那个高浓度的\N{\fnArial\fs30}About the blood samples, the ones with the high...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.85,0:19:54.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,催产素\N{\fnArial\fs30}...you know, oxytocin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.25,0:19:56.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还保存着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you still have them?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.39,0:19:59.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好  正好我们要用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. we need them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.39,0:20:00.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用来做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.36,0:20:02.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思  罗伯茨博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, dr. roberts?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.79,0:20:03.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.83,0:20:05.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.03,0:20:07.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们这里有点事情要处理  哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we're a little busy here, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.76,0:20:11.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也一样  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, so am i, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.67,0:20:14.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,博士  让我们单独聊会好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, could you give us a sec, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.04,0:20:16.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-当然  -谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sure.  - thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.14,0:20:19.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您贵姓\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.21,0:20:20.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼克·门罗  你俩呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick Monroe. what's yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.58,0:20:21.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是萨姆·斯泰尔斯特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm special agent sam stiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.98,0:20:23.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的搭档迪恩·梅铎克\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my partner -- dean murdock.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.91,0:20:25.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是哪个部门的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What office you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.15,0:20:27.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奥马哈市  暴力专案组\N{\fnArial\fs30}Omaha -- violent-crimes unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.02,0:20:28.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战略空军司令部派我过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}My s.a.c. sent me down here
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.05,0:20:29.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,调查一下这些杀人凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}To see about the murders.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.15,0:20:31.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.19,0:20:32.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,国防委员会\N{\fnArial\fs30}D.c.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.35,0:20:34.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,副部长派我们来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our assistant director assigned us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.12,0:20:35.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪位副部长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which a.d.?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.59,0:20:37.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦克·凯撒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike Kaiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.39,0:20:38.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的警号是多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are your badge numbers?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.59,0:20:39.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你逗我玩呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're kidding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.86,0:20:41.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只是我们见面的形式而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just following protocol.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.50,0:20:43.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别那么麻烦了  给我们副部长打个电话吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, whatever. just call our a.d.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.63,0:20:46.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会跟你说清楚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll sort things out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.78,0:21:00.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请帮我转接副部长凯撒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah, assistant director kaiser, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.78,0:21:04.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,部长你好  我是特工尼克·门罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sir, hello. it's agent nick monroe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.62,0:21:08.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想跟你了解一下你部门的两个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm calling about... two of your men --
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.12,0:21:10.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯泰尔斯和梅铎克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stiles and murdock?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.63,0:21:14.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们可能搞错了  正在插手我的案件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, it seems that they've been put on my case by mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.26,0:21:16.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是在质疑我们当局吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you questioning my authority?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.20,0:21:18.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是  不是  阁下  我没有在质疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, sir. I'm not questioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.23,0:21:19.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以愚弄我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have fooled me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.87,0:21:22.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我已经查了  孩子  国防委员会有管辖权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time I checked, son, d.c. has jurisdiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.57,0:21:23.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是我弄错了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.96,0:21:25.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  部长\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.97,0:21:27.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.34,0:21:29.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果下次你还想浪费我的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the next time you want to waste my time
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.51,0:21:32.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来问这些无聊的问题  我劝你还是省省吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}With stupid questions, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.22,0:21:37.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些糊涂蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those idjits.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.96,0:21:44.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm sorry, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.63,0:21:46.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再搞这样的事就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't let it happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.40,0:21:47.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这案子你们跟到哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, where are you at with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.80,0:21:49.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you at with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.63,0:21:51.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正要对这些血样进行调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I was about to run the perps' blood work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.43,0:21:53.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经查了  无果而终\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already checked. it's a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.24,0:21:54.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是吗  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, yeah?  - yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.80,0:21:58.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得能找到一些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, get this -- I feel like I found something
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.11,0:21:59.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把这些杀人犯们都联系起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That connects all the murderers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.74,0:22:01.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.01,0:22:04.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都是脱衣舞女\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were all banging strippers
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.05,0:22:05.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来自同一个俱乐部\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the same club.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.41,0:22:07.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说的不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.52,0:22:11.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一起去那看看怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say we go down there and check it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.22,0:22:13.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是问题所在  尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, here's the thing, nick.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.12,0:22:15.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们喜欢独来独往\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, we're kind of lone wolves --
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.16,0:22:16.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.43,0:22:18.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这想法听起来不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds like an excellent idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.16,0:22:19.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请稍候我们一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give me a second with my partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.66,0:22:21.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很快的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we'll, uh -- one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.23,0:22:22.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.70,0:22:26.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟  你得跟着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, you got to stay with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.07,0:22:27.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么  -别让他挡我们的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What?  - keep him out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.90,0:22:29.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.20,0:22:30.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我得去拿血样\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I got to get the blood samples.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.91,0:22:32.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我跟他在一起做什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell am I supposed to do with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.84,0:22:34.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带他去那个脱衣舞女俱乐部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just take him to the strip club,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.74,0:22:36.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关注一下海妖的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep an eye out for the siren.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.51,0:22:38.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好嘛  迪恩  只须把精力放在那些裸女上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, dean, just -- just focus on the naked girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.81,0:22:41.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就会忘了他的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll forget he's even there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.48,0:22:44.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是为你这么做的  我是为了那些女孩们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not doing this for you. I'm doing it for the girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.85,0:22:48.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐我的车吧  最好别抱怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're taking my ride. No complaining about the tunes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.12,0:22:50.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧  你是开这辆英帕拉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way. you drive an impala?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.39,0:22:51.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.59,0:22:54.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是67年的对吗  是个327四腔式的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a '67, right? it's a 327 4-barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.63,0:22:55.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说的不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.83,0:22:57.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太漂亮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a thing of beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.33,0:22:58.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.40,0:23:00.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么跟局里谈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell did you talk the bureau
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.17,0:23:01.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会让你开自己的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Into letting you drive your own wheels?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.74,0:23:05.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要这个血样是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you want this blood because...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.34,0:23:07.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们想做一些测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd like to run some tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.18,0:23:10.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有的测试我都会亲自做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I've run every test there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.68,0:23:12.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的工作呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, um...my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.61,0:23:14.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,注意我的工作服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Notice the lab coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.22,0:23:17.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们了解到有一位专家  想证明一个理论\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know a specialist who would like to try out a theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.39,0:23:21.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然你这么说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.33,0:23:28.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.13,0:23:29.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.16,0:23:32.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,血样没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blood's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.36,0:23:55.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Nobody's fault but mine."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.66,0:23:59.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,75年的策帕林飞艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, oh, oh, zeppelin recorded it, '75.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.09,0:24:01.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是一首盲人韦利·约翰森的曲子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a cover of a blind willie johnson tune.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.00,0:24:03.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.16,0:24:04.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,“你吓到我了”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"you shook me."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.60,0:24:07.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,69年  首张专辑  威利·狄克逊写得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, '69, debut album, written by willie dixon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.97,0:24:09.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.17,0:24:10.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.51,0:24:13.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是威利·狄克逊和巴顿·雷诺合作完成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Written by willie dixon and j.b. lenoir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.21,0:24:15.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.01,0:24:16.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.68,0:24:18.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作为一个联邦调查局探员  你还不算是混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, for a fed, you're not a total dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.98,0:24:21.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不都是联邦调查局探员吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't we both feds?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.55,0:24:23.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是  不  我只是  你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. no, I just, you know --
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.49,0:24:25.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是所有探员都跟我们一样酷  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a lot of feds as cool as us, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.02,0:24:28.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  伙计  那案子到底是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what the hell with this case, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.96,0:24:32.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能一个女孩子说服4个不同的人去杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does a girl talk four different johns into murder?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.73,0:24:34.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,疯狂的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy world.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.23,0:24:36.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.33,0:24:38.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你坦白说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, can I level with you? hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.17,0:24:39.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发现点奇怪的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found something kind of weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.17,0:24:42.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把你的疑虑带到正确的地方上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brought your weird to the right spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.54,0:24:43.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我说说看呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lay it on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.84,0:24:45.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我今早去了犯罪现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went to the crime scene this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.94,0:24:48.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看见他们把这个装了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saw them bagging this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.15,0:24:52.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我检查了所有档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I went back through all the files.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.01,0:24:53.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发现每个犯罪现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}It turns out a flower just like that
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.92,0:24:55.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都有这样的花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was found at every crime scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.52,0:24:57.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像是故意留下的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like it was left on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.02,0:24:59.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时候一个连环杀人案凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you know, sometimes a serial killer
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.09,0:25:01.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总会在现场留下个东西  比如说电话卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will leave an object behind, like a calling card.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.39,0:25:02.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是这个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But with this case?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.72,0:25:05.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟你说实话吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}To tell you the truth...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.89,0:25:07.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我完全理不清头绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got no idea what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.90,0:25:11.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I might.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.80,0:25:14.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以前见过这样的花\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen a flower like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.78,0:25:22.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经看了两遍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've watched them twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.41,0:25:23.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管取走血样的是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever took the blood...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.61,0:25:26.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定对这些录影带动过手脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must have tampered with the tapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.15,0:25:29.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁能自由出入你的办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}who has access to your office?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.12,0:25:30.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每个人  我不锁门的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone. I don't lock it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.49,0:25:32.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.39,0:25:35.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没碰上过这种问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never had this problem before.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.32,0:25:37.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些血究竟有多重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is so important about the blood, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.99,0:25:39.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人对犯人下了药\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think someone drugged the men
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.29,0:25:40.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他们犯罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}made them commit murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.66,0:25:41.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.00,0:25:43.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎样的药\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of drug?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.63,0:25:45.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I'm not sure yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.83,0:25:47.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.50,0:25:49.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我审问过这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I interviewed those guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.14,0:25:50.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们有自己的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they had their reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.54,0:25:52.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是  但是他们都深爱着受害人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but they all loved their victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.37,0:25:55.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相信他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.64,0:25:57.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.58,0:25:59.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你没谈过恋爱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't you ever been in a relationship
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.95,0:26:01.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当你深爱某人时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you really loved somebody
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.75,0:26:04.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仍想将他们杀死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And still kind of wanted to bash their head in?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.79,0:26:08.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听起来你感同身受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like you're speaking from experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.70,0:26:17.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  我无意问及你的私生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm sorry. i-i don't mean to pry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.40,0:26:18.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.93,0:26:21.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我提起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was the one who brought it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.91,0:26:28.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.41,0:26:35.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是药\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.45,0:26:38.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.50,0:26:52.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他叫卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name was carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.80,0:26:55.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们结了婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we were married.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.11,0:26:58.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.71,0:26:59.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.58,0:27:03.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  我爱过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I mean, I loved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.85,0:27:05.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在还爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still do, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.28,0:27:07.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, um, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.12,0:27:09.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像是某一天我认真审视了一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just like one day I looked up,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.25,0:27:11.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像自己跟一个陌生人生活在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was living with a stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.22,0:27:12.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.12,0:27:16.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道意思吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I mean, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.93,0:27:19.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.09,0:27:21.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者  也许我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or...i don't know. maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.90,0:27:26.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人总会变\N{\fnArial\fs30}People change.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.67,0:27:29.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝啊  我知道自己变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I know I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.97,0:27:31.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是没有丝毫的罪恶感\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's nothing to feel guilty about.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.54,0:27:32.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情就这么发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.11,0:27:36.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你们俩分开了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you two split up?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.68,0:27:38.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是  可以这么形容\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I suppose that's a word for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.15,0:27:47.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要接吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.39,0:27:51.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.69,0:27:53.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在不接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.77,0:27:59.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.84,0:28:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都有自己的一段悲情故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've all got our own sad stories, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.51,0:28:07.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,管它呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}...screw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.28,0:28:09.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该玩的时候好好玩  不要有遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have fun, no regrets,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.78,0:28:13.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今朝有酒今朝醉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And live life like there's no tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.39,0:28:20.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如说\N{\fnArial\fs30}For instance,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.69,0:28:25.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我整晚都在想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been thinking about you all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.80,0:28:28.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.90,0:28:29.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parts of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.00,0:28:31.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是部分吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just parts?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.57,0:28:37.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如说你的嘴唇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like your lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.84,0:28:41.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很让人分神\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're very distracting.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.34,0:28:43.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是个问题啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.01,0:28:50.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我忍不住想着要吻它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can't stop thinking about kissing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.42,0:28:51.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}That so?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.16,0:28:57.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.59,0:29:01.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还啰嗦什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}...what the hell, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.45,0:29:52.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  你他妈去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, where the hell have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.36,0:29:53.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟卡拉在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}With cara.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.36,0:29:55.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在叫卡拉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's "cara" now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.00,0:29:56.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也不接个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're not picking up your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.20,0:29:57.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们正努力找那些血样呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were trying to find the blood samples.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.57,0:29:59.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-被人偷了  -是啊 我打赌也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Someone stole them.  - yeah, I'll bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.57,0:30:00.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.94,0:30:02.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼克在犯罪现场找到了花瓣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick found flower petals at the crime scenes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.81,0:30:04.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是风信子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hyacinths.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.41,0:30:06.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那又怎样  -风信子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So?   - hyacinths?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.44,0:30:08.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来自地中海的一个小岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mediterranean, from the -- from the island
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.25,0:30:09.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里正是海妖神话传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the whole freakin' siren myth
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.43,0:30:10.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始流传的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}started in the first place
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.68,0:30:12.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.05,0:30:13.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  卡拉有风信子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, cara had hyacinth flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.15,0:30:16.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得卡拉是那个海妖吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think cara's the siren?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.72,0:30:18.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我查了一下她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I did a little checking up on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.12,0:30:19.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她才在这个镇子待了两个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's only been in town for two months.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.89,0:30:21.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.26,0:30:23.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她有个前夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she has an ex-husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.26,0:30:25.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个死掉的前夫  卡尔·罗伯茨\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dead ex-husband -- carl roberts.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.03,0:30:27.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消失无影  无任何征兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dropped like a stone, no warning,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.40,0:30:29.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,报道称其心脏病发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supposedly a heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.03,0:30:31.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  也许就是心脏病发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe it was a heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.24,0:30:32.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.47,0:30:34.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是觉得不是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I just don't think it's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.41,0:30:35.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是什么让你如此坚定呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what makes you so sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.61,0:30:36.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  直觉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. a hunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.91,0:30:38.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.11,0:30:39.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给你的是冰冷残酷的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm giving you cold, hard facts here,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.48,0:30:40.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你却回赠我一个直觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're giving me a hunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.18,0:30:44.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是跟她睡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you sleep with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.52,0:30:47.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.52,0:30:49.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胡扯  你跟她睡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy crap. you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.99,0:30:53.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真像在演“本能”啊  你居然跟莎朗·斯通睡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Middle of "basic instinct" and you bang sharon stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.49,0:30:55.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  现在你可能已经中了她的咒语了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you could be under her spell right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.36,0:30:56.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟  我没中她的咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, I'm not under her spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.83,0:30:58.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不敢相信  伙计  我只是不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unbelievable, man. I just don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.86,0:31:00.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.60,0:31:01.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.60,0:31:02.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.93,0:31:04.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's just --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.20,0:31:06.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一开始是麦蒂逊  然后是露比  现在卡拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}First it's madison, and then ruby, and now cara.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.30,0:31:08.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么了  老是喜欢跟魔鬼上床\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like what is with you and banging monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.21,0:31:09.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我告诉你  卡拉不是海妖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, dean, I'm telling you. it's not cara.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.44,0:31:10.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.74,0:31:11.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我打赌中咒语了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bet you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.94,0:31:13.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.18,0:31:14.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  因为这可能是已经被海妖迷上的结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}No because this could be the siren talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.41,0:31:15.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就告诉我你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, just tell me where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.88,0:31:18.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来见你  我们会把事情弄清楚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll come meet you, and we'll figure things out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.92,0:31:20.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.95,0:31:22.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.32,0:31:23.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但愿我是在瞎说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I weren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.86,0:31:27.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来搞定这件事  萨姆  一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to handle this, sam, by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.00,0:31:41.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆有麻烦了  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}sam's in trouble, bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.04,0:31:42.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我恐怕海妖对他施了咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the siren's worked her mojo on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.71,0:31:45.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收到留言立刻给我回电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a call as soon as you get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.02,0:31:52.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man. what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.32,0:31:54.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.02,0:31:56.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然可以  要怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, sure. with what?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.09,0:31:59.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彻查  我们要找个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Canvassing. we got to find somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.38,0:32:28.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她刚刚才进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}She went in just a second ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.59,0:32:29.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干得漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice work.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.92,0:32:31.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要跟进去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should we follow her in?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.12,0:32:32.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不  我不想打草惊蛇\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. I don't want to tip her off.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.66,0:32:34.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等着看她和谁一起出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just waiting to see who she comes out with.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.53,0:32:38.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you think, what...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.50,0:32:41.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她给这些人下药了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's drugging these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.00,0:32:42.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.54,0:32:47.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你听了这话会有什么反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how it sounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.00,0:32:48.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.37,0:32:50.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这简直奇怪得要命\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause it sounds like crazy on toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.31,0:32:51.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有这些脱衣舞女\N{\fnArial\fs30}All these different strippers --
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.98,0:32:53.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然都是同一个姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're magically the same girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.48,0:32:55.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但之后她们又都不再是脱衣舞女了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then they're not strippers at all --
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.11,0:32:56.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成了奎因医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's dr. quinn?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.28,0:32:57.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这有点难以解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of hard to explain,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.48,0:32:59.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我有理由的  说得通的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have my reasons, and they're good ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.12,0:33:00.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你只要相信我就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're just gonna have to trust me on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.95,0:33:02.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.95,0:33:04.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.89,0:33:06.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.29,0:33:09.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.63,0:33:11.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这么说我很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's actually nice to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.51,0:33:25.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么假设她给被害者下了药\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, let's say she is drugging her vics.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.51,0:33:28.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's she pulling that off?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.01,0:33:29.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有可能用了注射器\N{\fnArial\fs30}She could be injecting them,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.41,0:33:33.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者通过肢体接触来传播毒素\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, or passing the toxin through physical contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.65,0:33:37.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也有可能是用她的唾液\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or it could be her saliva.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.19,0:33:44.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在你深吻它之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really should have wiped the lip of that thing
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.10,0:33:46.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真该把它的嘴擦干净  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before you drank from it, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.90,0:33:52.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才应该是你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should be your little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.07,0:33:56.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.64,0:34:00.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能相信他\N{\fnArial\fs30}...you can't trust him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.55,0:34:03.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并表示可以相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not like you can trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.42,0:34:12.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  我真的认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, I really feel
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.06,0:34:15.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该把他赶走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you should get him out of the way
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.46,0:34:19.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那样我们就能当兄弟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that we can be brothers...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.06,0:34:21.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.90,0:34:28.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.94,0:34:32.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  你说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.50,0:34:46.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼克  你在这儿干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.21,0:34:50.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.85,0:34:57.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须告诉你  作为一个脱衣舞娘你真够丑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to tell you, you're one butt-ugly stripper.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.15,0:34:58.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.82,0:35:00.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我得到了自己正想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I got exactly what I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.25,0:35:01.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得到了迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.45,0:35:02.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  醒醒  老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.72,0:35:04.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是你  你能战胜它的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't you. you can fight this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.72,0:35:06.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.06,0:35:07.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你不给他来一刀呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you cut him
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.72,0:35:10.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在他的脖子上来一小下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a little on his neck right there?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.57,0:35:15.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩完全属于我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean's all mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.53,0:35:16.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给他下了毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You poisoned him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.67,0:35:18.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我实现了他的愿望\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I gave him what he needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.30,0:35:20.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可不是什么穿丁字裤的婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it wasn't some bitch in a g-string.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.57,0:35:22.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.81,0:35:25.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个敬仰他的弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little brother that looked up to him
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.11,0:35:27.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个他可以信任的弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}That he could trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.24,0:35:29.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在他爱的是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now he loves me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.98,0:35:32.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会为我做任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd do anything for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.68,0:35:34.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I got to tell you, sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.35,0:35:37.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是一种热爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}That kind of devotion --
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.22,0:35:40.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着有人为你去杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watching someone kill for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.93,0:35:43.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是最至高无上的快感\N{\fnArial\fs30}...is the best feeling in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.73,0:35:45.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就因为这个你把整个镇子都睡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that why you're slutting all over town?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.60,0:35:50.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我厌倦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.47,0:35:52.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like we all do.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.70,0:35:54.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想再度坠入爱河\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I want to fall in love again
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.94,0:35:58.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一次又一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}And again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.38,0:36:00.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你  我对付过不少下流的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell you what, I have fought some nasty sons of bitches,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.54,0:36:05.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你却是一个卑贱可悲的孬种\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are one needy, pathetic loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.42,0:36:08.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很快就不会这么想了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't feel that way in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.55,0:36:11.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.37,0:36:28.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你们两\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I know you two
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.27,0:36:30.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有许多不堪回首的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a lot you want to get off your chests.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.67,0:36:33.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不如你们讨论一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why don't you discuss it...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.08,0:36:38.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后活下来的那个就能永远和我在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whoever survives can be with me forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.72,0:36:46.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道是什么时候开始的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't know when it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.09,0:36:48.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是我在地狱的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe when I was in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.66,0:36:52.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是我凝视着你的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe when I was staring right at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.36,0:36:54.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我所认识的萨姆已经不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the sam I knew, he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.30,0:36:55.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那又怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That so?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.57,0:36:59.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟恶魔之血和灵魂之类的鬼扯无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's not the demon blood or the psychic crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.30,0:37:01.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是一些小事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the little stuff --
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.97,0:37:03.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些谎言  那些秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lies, the secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.71,0:37:04.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.94,0:37:06.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}What secrets?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.14,0:37:07.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如说  跟露比通电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phone calls to ruby, for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.84,0:37:09.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我打电话还得经过你同意咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I need your say-so to make a phone call?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.95,0:37:11.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这正是关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.65,0:37:13.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有事瞒着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're hiding things from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.35,0:37:15.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还有什么事没告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else aren't you telling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.49,0:37:17.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟你没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.49,0:37:19.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白我刚的话了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}See what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.06,0:37:23.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们曾经在同一条战线上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We used to be in this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.19,0:37:24.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曾经互相依靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}We used to have each other's backs!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.60,0:37:26.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行  好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.03,0:37:27.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道为什么不把露比的事告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to know why I didn't tell you about ruby?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.20,0:37:30.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有我们是怎样追捕莉莉丝的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how we're hunting down lilith?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.67,0:37:33.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你要抓她还不够格  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're too weak to go after her, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.50,0:37:35.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会拖我后腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're holding me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.31,0:37:37.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作为一个猎手我比你出色得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a better hunter than you are --
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.58,0:37:40.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更强壮  更聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stronger, smarter.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.14,0:37:42.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能把你唯恐避之不及的恶魔控制住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can take out demons you're too scared to go near.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.05,0:37:43.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一派胡言\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.18,0:37:44.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只会坐在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're too busy sitting around
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.62,0:37:46.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自怨自艾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feeling sorry for yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.05,0:37:48.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唠叨那些你在地狱里折磨过的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whining about all the souls you tortured in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.57,0:38:07.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别想再碍着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not standing in my way anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.77,0:38:45.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了我  上吧  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it for me, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.91,0:38:54.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有种再说遍我多窝囊  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me again how weak I am, sam, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.15,0:38:56.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是怎么拖你后腿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How I hold you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.63,0:39:05.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.76,0:39:07.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.12,0:39:56.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.50,0:39:58.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苏打水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soda?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.74,0:40:01.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是不是精力太旺盛啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You boys are driving, ain't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.15,0:40:09.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.48,0:40:12.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你  你来帮忙之前深藏不露\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you -- you hadn't shown up when you did --
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.68,0:40:15.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们又何尝不是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Done the same for me, more than once.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.55,0:40:18.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  你们只要拿起电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, you could have picked up a phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.59,0:40:20.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拨一通就能查到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only took one call to figure out
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.62,0:40:22.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个尼克·门罗特工是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That agent nick monroe wasn't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.60,0:40:32.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You boys gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.27,0:40:33.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.60,0:40:35.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.68,0:40:46.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些海妖很险恶的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, those sirens are nasty things.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.75,0:40:50.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一旦它缠上你  总是感觉良好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That it got to you -- that's no reason to feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.53,0:41:06.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要跟卡拉道别吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna say goodbye to cara?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.64,0:41:08.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.61,0:41:11.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.64,0:41:13.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗  为什么不呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.88,0:41:16.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么意义呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.11,0:41:19.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看你  相爱却又要别离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look at you. love 'em and leave 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.02,0:41:25.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你知道我不是故意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, look, you know I didn't mean
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.59,0:41:27.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要说那些话的  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The things I said back there, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.22,0:41:29.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是中了海妖的咒语才这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That it was just the siren's spell talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.16,0:41:30.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. me too.
